WEBVTT

00:12:27.218 --> 00:12:30.642
The Earth Archive is a bet
on the future of humanity.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.307
It's a bet that together,

00:12:33.331 --> 00:12:34.948
collectively,

00:12:34.972 --> 00:12:38.039
as people and as scientists,

00:12:38.063 --> 00:12:40.770
that we'll face the climate crisis

00:12:40.794 --> 00:12:42.994
and that we'll choose
to do the right thing,

00:12:43.915 --> 00:12:45.845
not just for us today

00:12:46.932 --> 00:12:49.878
but to honor those who came before us

00:12:49.902 --> 00:12:54.257
and to pay it forward
to future generations

00:12:54.281 --> 00:12:56.563
who will carry on our legacy.

00:12:57.373 --> 00:12:58.539
Thank you.

00:12:58.903 --> 00:13:01.388
(Applause)